{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，扫读效率明显不如X：Y虽然用重点加亮和感受定时出现降低了部分阅读负担，但话与感受纵向交替、固定感受又较密集，短时段尤其容易来不及兼顾。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y更能让人理解人物内心的具体矛盾：他怀念的不是受气的生活，而是曾经被当作自己人、不必时时防备的亲近；他害怕孤单，却又不愿为陪伴重新忍受委屈。重点加亮让每段心理转折更容易被抓住，反复出现的亲近、受气、想念、独自承担等线索也把前后串成了一件事。更重要的是，Y的音乐感受有明显更细的层次，从节奏、音型、力度、停顿到身体感受和情绪变化都有具体对应，X虽然更好扫读，但不少感受停留在概括性描述，细腻度和音乐叙事的丰富程度不及Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4bb48cd8-f6a2-428b-9fd3-b8d3884ab3f7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T040903735913Z", "elapsed_seconds": 80.032, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T04:10:23.782706+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6c40be603e116acab7d23404fe6c4493bbb64f52faa4ec4df42373a9085c82e4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a3